{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 91971, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 64509, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "11.11火RB组队攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1636709426, "updated_at": 1637396904, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1637396904, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "1.RBBOSS难点BOSSNSSSDS都会给自己叠加防御力，防御会非常高，DS会气绝我方剩余HP最多天子并给予自己极速成长BUFF（攻防增加），会给我方天子上出血、切断DEBUFF，伤害很高，同时B", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7427, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 91971, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">1.RB BOSS难点</p></div><br></div><div>BOSS NS SS DS都会给自己叠加防御力，防御会非常高，DS会气绝我方剩余HP最多天子并给予自己极速成长BUFF（攻防增加），会给我方天子上出血、<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">切断</span>DEBUFF，伤害很高，同时BOSS的DS伤害也非常高，很多人会暴毙都是因为出血叠了太多层，被BOSS一个切断爆掉当然会暴毙，所以应对思路就是解DEBUFF。</div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">2.应对策略</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※不要纯上奶盾天子，天子暴毙的原因就是<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">出血叠了太多层，被BOSS一个切断爆掉，加上高伤DS，应对思路就是解DEBUFF</span></span><br></div><div>※水丹丹可以说是必需品，DEBUFF无效、回血、双刃，堪称完美</div><div>※除了刀，其他人尽量全带温泉魂卡（增加DEBUFF回避）或者挨打回血魂卡，前面提到的魂卡不够的话伪娘可以带挨打加速魂卡</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※刀武器第三条附魔吸血（练度高没有也可以）</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※不带奶肯定是会死人的，最优选择情人节巧克力奶（2人缓回+3人DEBUFF无效，能吃到水系加速，+0就比花奶好），其次花奶（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">2人缓回+DEBUFF无效，但是吃不到加速很致命，因为奶转圈很慢，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">除非你P了或者练度很高满火</span></span>）</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※带一个奶顶不住情况下（RB打到后面一般都顶不住），阿罗汉换牡丹或者莫娜（莫娜需要堆肉一点否则容易被秒），牡丹N可以解除出血并转化为缓回，莫娜N则是解除出血加吸血，雪初音奶+净化</span><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※新人或者练度不够的直接上巧克力奶<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;\">or雪初音</span>（花奶）+莫娜or牡丹！如果这样你还顶不住会死人，那就巧克力奶<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;\">（花奶）+萝莉盾</span></span></span><br></span></span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">3.DS设置</p></div><br></div><div>1.水丹丹 &nbsp;2.情人节巧克力奶或者花奶 3.伪娘</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">4.队长设置</p></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※</span>低加情人节巧克力奶（单奶）选水丹丹队长</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※高加（+5以上）</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">情人节巧克力奶选阿罗汉队长</span></div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">※有对策<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">选对策队长</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div data-col=\"6\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"71320\" d